@startuml
' State diagram of vault project 'financials' — PlantUML source.
' Entity: entity/ledger-transaction-row — Ledger transaction row (journal.Transaction)
' States: 3 · Transitions: 2 (of 2)

' States (declared first — nothing referenced before declared)
state "stated" as s0
state "recorded" as s1
state "shifted" as s2

' Transitions (from --> to : event [condition])
s0 --> s1 : the owner states a\nrealized movement and it\npasses admission [date\nnot in the future,\napproved category,\nnon-zero amount]
s1 --> s2 : any later-dated entry is\nrecorded or an existing\nrow is edited or deleted\n[the row sits after the\nchange in date order, so\nits balances absorb the\ndifference]

@enduml
